  "visibleTextNormalized": "HomeSchool lifeForms Forms The forms below are provided for the convenience of parents/carers, members of the public and students to easily submit forms electronically any day at any time. The forms will be automatically directed to the appropriate staff. You will receive an acknowledgment with a copy of any form you submit. Forms, and Responses, are also available on the School Bytes Parent Portal. Parent/Student forms Description Change of Student/Parent details (opens in new window) Use this form to update Contact details for Parents & Students. Permission to Publish (opens in new window) Use this form to update Permission to Publish. Application for Extended Leave (opens in new window) Use this form to apply for planned extended leave from school for 5 days or more. Request to Change Student Special Religious Education Participation (opens in new window) To request to change participation in Special Religious Education classes. Need help with attendance? If you have questions about arrival times or absences, please contact us. Contact us Travel to school Learn about local transport options and how to get here safely. east Parent portal Use our parent portal apps to make a payment, view reports and record absences. east Section navigation School life Bell times Bring your own device Canteen Events Forms House and Merit System Lockers and lost property Newsletters Parent portal Stationery Student opportunities and activities Travel to school Uniform",
